'''Joshua O'Neal Jackson''' (born February 10, 1997) is an American professional [[basketball]] player who last played for the [[Stockton Kings]] of the [[NBA G League]]. He played [[college basketball]] for one season with the [[Kansas Jayhawks men's basketball|Kansas Jayhawks]] before declaring for the [[2017 NBA draft]], where he was selected fourth overall by the [[Phoenix Suns]].

